			)
		)
		(property "BOM Comments" "SENSOR-C power upgrade. Pin-compatible LMR436x0 RPE family; inherited symbol pin map verified against TI Rev B p4. FB8 MUST use divider, not direct output. Original MB3 symbol graphic retained; purchase MPN is MB5."
