		(property "Function" "Clamps +3V0_REF to about 0.3 V above +3V3_A when the buck collapses before +5V_A, protecting U13 REFIO (through R107) and U8 VREF+. Place south of U5 with the anode fed from the U5 VOUT via on B.Cu and the cathode on C48 pad 1, at least 3 mm from L1/SW copper."
